@BankRUs.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### Öppna konto
POST https://localhost:8000/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "firstName": "Bolly",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "socialSecurityNumber": "189002039817",
  "email": "bolly@doe.com"
}


### Öppna bankkonto
POST https://localhost:8000/api/bank-accounts
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "userId": "4882a05f-4406-4f9c-9647-4c1bf901bff8",
  "name": "Semesterkonto"
}

### Transaction
POST https://localhost:8000/api/bank-accounts/567e715d-58b2-4f20-a41e-1b41c65cbbe2/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..UgAAkNyHcjfNnFdysjooDiKBeA5lTimIB6aikGZVTGg

{
  "amount": 250.00,
  "reference": "Lön januari"
}
### Withdrawals
POST https://localhost:8000/api/bank-accounts/567e715d-58b2-4f20-a41e-1b41c65cbbe2/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..UgAAkNyHcjfNnFdysjooDiKBeA5lTimIB6aikGZVTGg

{
  "amount": 90.00,
  "reference": "Uttag bankomat"
}


### Hämta alla konton för en användare
GET https://localhost:8000/api/accounts/4882a05f-4406-4f9c-9647-4c1bf901bff8

### Logga in / Autentisera
POST https://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "username": "bolly@doe.com",
  "password": "Secret#1"
}


### Hämta kontouppgifter
GET https://localhost:8000/api/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..x2cRN5TsZA_G34_thtEZK3OK_Rx0vxtjFxMBQzBKkRA



